From d002e203a76e8a92ec48c47c6466eb98bcc1308b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: u1131128 <hipac1@lsalab.cs.nthu.edu.tw>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:57:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] CBC: queue the per-face kernels and scalar updates async, one
 wait per s_cbc call

Each s_cbc call issued ~12 small kernels and 5 scalar updates, each followed by a blocking
stream synchronize (~230 us of host round trips per call on H200). The work is GPU-to-GPU
only, so it now goes on the OpenACC async queue with a wait before the synchronous
primitive-to-flux conversion and one at the end of s_cbc. OpenMP path unchanged.
---
 src/simulation/m_cbc.fpp | 94 +++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 1 file changed, 50 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

